---
source: crates/m2-server-core/tests/skills.rs
expression: h.log
---
-- strength: its points, the attack grade with them
@1000 conn#4 sends RaiseStatus 12
   -> event: conn#4: character 1 raised point 12 to 7
   -> send conn#4 PointsChanged 12=7 18=24 26=2
-- vitality to 90, the highest: more health and defence, not healed
@1000 conn#4 sends RaiseStatus 13
   -> event: conn#4: character 1 raised point 13 to 90
   -> send conn#4 PointsChanged 6=4380 13=90 16=77 20=77 26=1
@1000 conn#4 sends RaiseStatus 13
   -> send conn#4 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "Vitality cannot go any higher."
-- intelligence: the last point, more mana; then none left
@1000 conn#4 sends RaiseStatus 15
   -> event: conn#4: character 1 raised point 15 to 4
   -> send conn#4 PointsChanged 8=500 15=4 26=0
@1000 conn#4 sends RaiseStatus 14
   -> send conn#4 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "You have no status points left."
-- another point number is ignored
@1000 conn#4 sends RaiseStatus 28
-- the stats are saved with the character
@1000 conn#4 closed: the client left
   -> store #8: save #1 at (475000, 966100) played 0s
   -> event: conn#4: closed: the client left
@1000 store answers #8: saved: Ok(())
